<title>USA: Minntech oxygenator gets FDA marketing nod.</title>
<headline>Minntech oxygenator gets FDA marketing nod.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minntech Corp said Friday it received 510(k) market clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market its Biocor 200 High Performance Oxygenator in the United States.</p>
<p>The product, a cardiosurgery device that replaces the function of the lungs during open-heart surgery, uses advanced technology in the heat exchanger. Minntech has manufactured membrane oxygenators since 1988.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
